  <!-- EN: vicious UV sensitivity -->
  <AG_Sensitivity_Vicious.label>sensibilidade cruel a UV</AG_Sensitivity_Vicious.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have biological compounds in their skin that react viciously to UV radiation. They are so sensitive to sunlight that standing under the sun will knock them unconscious. -->
  <AG_Sensitivity_Vicious.description>Portadores deste gene têm compostos biológicos na pele que reagem cruelmente à radiação UV. São tão sensíveis à luz do sol que ficar sob o sol os deixa inconscientes.</AG_Sensitivity_Vicious.description>
