  <!-- EN: lethal UV sensitivity -->
  <AG_Sensitivity_Lethal.label>sensibilidade letal a UV</AG_Sensitivity_Lethal.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have biological compounds in their skin that react lethally to UV radiation. They are so sensitive to sunlight that standing under the sun will burn them and kill them in a few minutes. -->
  <AG_Sensitivity_Lethal.description>Portadores deste gene têm compostos biológicos na pele que reagem de forma letal à radiação UV. São tão sensíveis à luz do sol que ficar sob o sol os queima e os mata em poucos minutos.</AG_Sensitivity_Lethal.description>
