  <!-- EN: UV powered -->
  <AG_UVPowered_Mild.label>movido a UV</AG_UVPowered_Mild.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have biological compounds in their skin that are rejuvenated and recharged when subject to UV radiation. They'll be reinvigorated when exposed to sunlight, but lethargic when away from it. -->
  <AG_UVPowered_Mild.description>Portadores deste gene têm compostos biológicos na pele que se renovam e recarregam com radiação UV. Ficam revigorados expostos à luz do sol, mas letárgicos longe dela.</AG_UVPowered_Mild.description>
  <!-- EN: UV-powered -->
  <AG_UVPowered_Mild.labelShortAdj>movido a UV</AG_UVPowered_Mild.labelShortAdj>
